}}'''Fireplace''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 13th tier of the [[Christmas Event 2023]].  It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
This knife uses the default knife mesh. It has orange bricks on the handle and on the bottom of the blade there are red berries and fire to resemble a fireplace, hence the name.  

